Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:11.41,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Sera, you've really improved!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:13.42,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,And you used to be \Nsuch a cute little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:19.85,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I trained extensively because I wanted \Nto be a great knight like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:22.20,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,What a sweet thing to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:23.48,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.83,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina is strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:29.06,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,to stand against the legendary \NPrincess Wysteresia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:32.98,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure. \NThey are only training, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:37.60,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,And Lady Wysteresia has always \Npreferred wielding two swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:40.85,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Looks like I won't need to hold \Nback against you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:43.87,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Right! Please, fight seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.08,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:11.46,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Your skill with a blade lives \Nup to your legend, Resia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:14.17,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Those eyes of yours do you credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:15.99,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You're already used to my strikes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:16.68,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:28.31,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You've become a fine knight, Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:31.68,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,If you weren't holding back \Nout of admiration for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.19,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,I bet you'd be stronger than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:39.07,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,If you really feel that way, \Nwhy resort to blinding me with dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:41.29,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have, if I wanted \Nto fight like a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:43.82,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,But we've got fire-breathing \Ndragons in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.82,0:01:48.58,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You start getting all huffy over a bit \Nof dirt, and you'll be dead in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:51.04,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,The willingness to resort \Nto whatever it takes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:53.67,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,while still maintaining such \Nrefined and vigorous willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:59.59,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,Who she is at her core remains unchanged.\NShe's still direct and brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.42,0:02:02.01,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:05.73,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,There was the time she disguised \Nherself as a village girl
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:07.63,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,to destroy a bandit hideout...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.81,0:02:20.87,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,By intentionally getting kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:22.40,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,It's her willingness to use
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:24.87,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,such free-wheeling tactics \Nunbecoming of a knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:31.65,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,that gave rise to so many legends...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:36.76,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, Sister. \NI'll try and keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:45.18,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sera. I got some dirt \Non your engagement necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:47.41,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.41,0:02:50.51,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Yeah. Wash it off later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:53.63,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I thought it didn't come off?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:55.25,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Of course it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:59.04,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Why'd you think it wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:01.20,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,There's no latch...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:02.91,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Did Veo not explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:05.94,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,If you will it to come off, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:09.29,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,How does that work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:12.48,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,It reacts to willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:15.92,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Try touching it while wishing \Nstrongly for it to come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:18.41,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:22.18,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,Come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:30.63,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Then even something \Nlike this is enchanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:36.08,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Well, if a weapon's enchantment reacts \Nto the desire to defend or attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:39.17,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,is it really that strange that there's \Na necklace that reacts to the desire
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.19,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,to come undone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:41.70,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:46.45,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,The idea is that the necklace would \Ncome off if you didn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:48.81,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:55.05,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,She didn't seem to catch on to what \Nthat implies since it never came off...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:05.84,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:08.47,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,An engagement necklace...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:13.15,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What am I thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.06,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Attach!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:19.81,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Necklace! Attach!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.81,0:04:22.56,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Attach! Attach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:26.49,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,It won't attach...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:29.34,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,B-But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:53.61,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2500,1725)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HFAFDFE&\3c&H3D6671&\4c&H372771&\shad2}T{\c&HF8FCFD&}h{\c&HF6FBFC&}e{\c&HF4FAFB&} {\c&HF2F9FA&}W{\c&HF1F8FA&}a{\c&HEFF7F9&}r{\c&HEDF6F8&}r{\c&HEBF5F7&}i{\c&HE9F4F6&}o{\c&HE7F3F5&}r{\c&HE5F2F4&} {\c&HE3F1F3&}P{\c&HE2F0F3&}r{\c&HE0EFF2&}i{\c&HDEEEF1&}n{\c&HDCEDF0&}c{\c&HDAECEF&}e{\c&HD8EBEE&}s{\c&HD6EAED&}s{\c&HD4E9EC&} {\c&HD3E7EC&}a{\c&HD1E6EB&}n{\c&HCFE5EA&}d{\c&HCDE4E9&} {\c&HCBE3E8&}t{\c&HC9E2E7&}h{\c&HC7E1E6&}e{\c&HC5E0E5&} {\c&HC4DFE5&}B{\c&HC2DEE4&}a{\c&HC0DDE3&}r{\c&HBEDCE2&}b{\c&HBCDBE1&}a{\c&HBADAE0&}r{\c&HB8D9DF&}i{\c&HB6D8DE&}c{\c&HB5D7DE&} {\c&HB3D6DD&}K{\c&HB1D5DC&}i{\c&HAFD4DB&}n{\c&HADD3DA&}g
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.88,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You can't put the necklace back on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:06.02,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I've been wishing strongly \Nfor it to do so, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.51,0:06:08.63,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,It just won't change back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:11.65,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,What do you suppose is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:13.89,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Oh, well to put it back on...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:18.10,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,There's a little ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:21.39,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You need to sneak up on the person \Nwho gave it to you, from behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:24.15,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Douse them with water, \Nto cleanse them, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:29.52,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You go like this and whisper "Guess who?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:31.57,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Right in their ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.44,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Try saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.41,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,G-Guess who...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.74,0:06:40.33,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Sexier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:42.39,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:44.56,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:46.49,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:49.45,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Put some real femininity in it, \Nlike a mature, older woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:51.55,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:55.69,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,G-Guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:58.57,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:01.08,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You're getting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:04.02,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You'll wanna include notes \Nof purity, open mindedness,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.05,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,and strength that calls to mind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:09.04,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,the harshness of the eastern lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:10.90,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:15.13,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Then when he calls your name, \N it'll be a nice little setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:20.76,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,And all of this childishness will really \Nlet me put the necklace back on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:24.64,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,The more primitive the ritual, \Nthat more it tends to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.92,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Is that really the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:27.46,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:31.34,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I have to do all this... to Veor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:32.84,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,You sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:35.10,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,What do you think? Can you pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:38.61,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Um... I think... so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:42.48,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.60,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:48.02,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,That said, you gotta keep the \Nnecklace coming off a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:50.09,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Don't let Veo see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:52.99,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,That seems like a much bigger challenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:57.19,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I'm going to borrow this basin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:59.51,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:04.39,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Ma'am, why did you tell her... all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:08.67,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,None of it is necessary to \Nput the necklace back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:11.76,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,I just said it'd be a nice setup!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.42,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Not that it'd let her put it back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:16.93,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,I mean, we're talking about Veo and Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:21.01,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,How many years do you think we'd have to \Nwait if we don't give them a little push?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.01,0:08:23.14,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,This comes a little too close to meddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:28.87,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,I'd just like my grandchild to \Nsee me while I'm still pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.35,0:08:32.40,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're getting ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:46.23,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I can't let him see me, and I have \Nto douse him with this water...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:47.79,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:52.02,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Thanks ever so much. \NIt was so darn heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:55.30,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,A bit of firewood was no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:56.69,Main,Gatar,0,0,0,,Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:08:59.25,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,What is it? Why do you want up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:09.24,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:13.44,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Veor! \NI'll wholeheartedly apologize later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:16.83,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,It seems the best way to do this would \Nbe in a place with no one else around...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:20.63,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Did it just rain, but only \Non Master Thunder Voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:23.95,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell you, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:31.13,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera wouldn't do that sort \Nof thing without some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:33.63,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You want to know Master Veor's schedule?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:38.30,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I thought it best to target \Nmy quarry when they're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.38,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Quarry...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.32,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're taking this more \Nseriously than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:44.59,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:47.92,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,It is a knight's duty to see something \Nthrough once they've started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:49.02,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:52.25,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You nobles really are such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:57.53,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,What Veor's doing today and\Nwhere he's going. Anything will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:00.91,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Mother, where is Sera?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:03.35,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Stepped out for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:04.54,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.66,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:10.04,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Are things going well \Nbetween you and Sera?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.06,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:19.55,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Listen up. If you care about \Na woman, you need to show her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:21.44,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,How do I do that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.06,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,With a gift! As a symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:27.30,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Think of it as an offering \Nto the woman you love!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:33.29,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you could tell me \Nwhat would be a good gift, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.94,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Use your own damn head...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:38.44,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,is what I'd normally say, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:42.20,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,How about something unusual to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:46.19,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,And then you make it into \Nsomething delicious to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:48.49,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,so that it really means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:50.63,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,That's more mundane than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.61,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,I'm going to check on the saplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:57.84,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,You'll wanna look for something nearby,\Nbut with as few people around as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:11:01.01,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Someplace you could knock boots \Nand no one would hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:04.22,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Knock...?! Really, Mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.19,0:11:10.35,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor went to check on the saplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:12.86,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,The place where the great \Ncleansing was performed, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:16.23,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,There's plenty of cover to shadow \Nhim while staying hidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:19.35,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,To say nothing of spots \Nto sneak up behind him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.35,0:11:22.24,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Just try not to be a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:25.58,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'll apologize later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:28.50,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,That really isn't the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:31.80,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Why am I stuck doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:32.76,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Malcius.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:38.94,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Serafina de Lavillant is taking \Nto the field of battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:40.51,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Huh? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:43.51,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Something unusual to eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:46.67,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Well, the saplings seem to have \Ntaken to the ground well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.67,0:11:49.78,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,There's nothing as wondrous as \Nseeing greenery restored to land
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:51.06,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,that was once close to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:54.27,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Veor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:12:01.41,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,He reacted to the slight \Nsurge of willpower just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:02.28,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:07.38,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.54,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.21,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:16.04,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I can't be seen in the middle \Nof the ritual! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:22.78,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Ritual...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:30.18,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,This is going to be more \Ndifficult than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:34.19,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:36.85,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,Perhaps a more offensive \Napproach will work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:27.66,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Honestly, Sera... I'm not \Nsure the hat is helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:37.63,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,He notices me every single time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:39.92,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,What is he, a wild animal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:44.44,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,How am I ever going to \Nsneak up behind him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:48.49,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong \Nwith Lady Serafina today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:52.31,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Life can be fine a second time around...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:56.88,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:14:02.77,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,No! I told Resia I would do this,\N so I can't just give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:06.26,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Actually, this has nothing to do with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:10.59,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,As a knight, I've begun this undertaking! \NIt's not unlike taking an oath!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:14.09,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,So this ritual will be a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.09,0:14:17.40,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Wait... I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:19.94,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,One of Resia's legends may hold the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:27.58,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It had gotten a bit long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:30.39,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,How were the saplings?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:33.61,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,No problems there, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:36.56,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,There's something that's \Nbeen bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.55,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:41.96,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera's been acting rather strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:45.79,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's like she has some business with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:48.33,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,But when I try to talk \Nto her, she runs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:51.57,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Cersei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:56.08,Flashback,Resia,0,0,0,,Keep the crock ritual a \Nsecret from Veo, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:03.34,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I wonder if I've done \Nsomething to upset her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:06.89,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I... I don't think that's the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:10.47,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Um... Does anything come to mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:12.97,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,One thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.81,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The engagement necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:27.11,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I put it on her when she was brought \Nhere, while she was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.45,0:15:30.69,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I had intended to tell her \Nwhat it represented...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.69,0:15:33.87,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,but in the end, Mother told her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:39.37,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I may have been afraid... \Nof being rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:45.38,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,So I was happy enough that \Nshe was wearing it at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:49.26,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Putting the issue aside, \Ninstead of addressing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.15,0:15:51.76,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:57.61,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It could be that she's upset with \Nmy cowardice, in regards to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:15:59.27,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That she finds me pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:05.65,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I don't think Sera would be disappointed \Nin you over something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:08.65,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Not when you're trying so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:10.95,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:13.05,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:25.92,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I think I may need to face her again \Nand tell her how I truly feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:28.67,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for suddenly calling on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:34.05,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,But I need your cooperation! \NAre you willing to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:36.68,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What is this?! And so suddenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:39.55,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,It's something I can only ask you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:43.69,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,But, with this plan, \Nrooted in the legends of Resia...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:46.19,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:47.99,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,A plan...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:53.21,Italics,Malcius,0,0,0,,Could it be that Lady Serafina is \Nfinally fed up with these barbarians
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:56.11,Italics,Malcius,0,0,0,,and is scheming to escape with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:17:00.08,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I-If it's something I can do to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.08,0:17:02.90,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Really?! Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:04.61,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Let's get started, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:11.84,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:16.95,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:18.64,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Where is she going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:24.10,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,W-Wait, please! \NI need to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.57,0:17:25.49,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.11,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:35.24,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Wh-What the—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.11,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,I have you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.53,0:17:43.80,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,Egads!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:47.91,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,Damn you, Veor... You had a weapon \Nlike this up your sleeve?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:50.86,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,I should've expected as much from the \Nman who can fight me to a standstill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:51.54,Italics,Sera,0,0,0,,And yet—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.83,0:17:58.05,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I won't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:03.31,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:10.06,Italics,Veor,0,0,0,,Uh... That voice could really \Nonly belong to one person...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:14.17,Italics,Veor,0,0,0,,What is this? Am I being \Ntested in some way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:17.34,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Answer me. What's my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.82,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Your name is Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:24.59,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Serafina de Lavillant. Is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:29.54,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:32.00,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Necklace! Attach!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:41.26,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Wh-Why isn't it working?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:44.26,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera... could you explain what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:49.27,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Um, well... Resia told \Nme about the ritual...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:52.80,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Since I took the necklace \Noff and... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:55.28,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,So, this is Mother's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:19:00.82,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's obviously nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:17.55,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Mother... could you please refrain \Nfrom teasing Sera like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:23.50,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,I just told her it'd be a nice setup. \NNot an untrue word was spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:25.81,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Besides, without a little \Nextra motivation...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:29.85,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for what she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:36.36,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,No, I should've remembered that \NSister can be... capricious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:42.05,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough apologizing, \Nlet's enjoy this grub Cersei made us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.85,0:19:47.08,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I think Sera's perception of you as a \Nheroic princess who met a tragic end...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.80,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,might color her perception.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.33,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,You might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:54.52,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I really do need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:57.82,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I was such a nuisance... \NI hope you can forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:04.59,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,No, it was nothing you should \Nworry about. If anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:10.10,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera... would you join me for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.35,0:20:12.57,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:14.60,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:22.61,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.97,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,May I see the necklace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.56,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:36.00,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,In order to put this on, \Nan oath must be recited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:38.00,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,An oath...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:44.51,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera, I would like to once again \Ngive you this engagement necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:48.47,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:49.99,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,S-Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.99,0:20:54.27,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I'm... not... against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.86,0:20:57.02,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,I feel anxious without it, frankly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.87,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:02.68,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You have no idea how happy \Nit makes me to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:07.96,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Thundering maelstrom whose domain is \Nbetween the earth and the stormclouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:10.87,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,divine dragon whose will is law...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:14.54,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Armor of rulers, Orkfiem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:30.85,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,In thy glorious name, \NI hereby forge this bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.19,0:21:37.41,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I bid you to unite this maiden and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:44.74,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,And for as long as she \Nholds me in her heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:48.13,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,until such a time as my life ends...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.13,0:21:50.53,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,let our fates be intertwined.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:22:00.46,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That is the prayer pact necessary \Nto put the necklace on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:05.14,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I hope it conveyed to \Nyou how I honestly feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:09.48,Main,Sera,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:16.23,Sign_Basic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(750,0)\shad0\fs11\bord1\c&HBACBD0&\3c&H506972&\b1\blur1\pos(606,200)}Translation: Lee Francis\N\NTiming: Andy Ellis\N\NEditing: Zachary Carlysle\N\NQuality Control: Salem Alabanza\N\NTranslation Check: Sho Stifler
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.23,0:22:19.51,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,I wonder how Veo's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:21.48,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Not that I care...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:23.97,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,but what do we do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:28.74,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:32.19,Main - Top,Resia,0,0,0,,I feel kinda bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.19,0:22:34.26,Main - Top,Resia,0,0,0,,Should I pat her head?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:38.16,Main - Top,Cersei,0,0,0,,I don't think you should sully \Nyour hands like that, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:45.73,Main,Resia,0,0,0,,Looks like it went well.

